sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant BI as billing
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S as session
  participant W as worker
  W->>+S: delegate [readers]
  Note over S: guard: escalate
  S->>DB: approval: pending
  S->>DB: task: waiting
  S-->>B: task waiting (/ws)
  S-->>-W: waiting
  W->>S: done (waiting)
  Note over W: ack the turn
  B->>+BI: grant approval
  BI->>DB: approval: consumed
  BI-->>-B: 200
  loop outbox, 30 s lease
    BI->>DB: claim row
    BI->>+S: approvals/resume
  end
  S->>DB: find the task
  Note over S: guard: allow
  S->>DB: child tasks
  S-->>-BI: 200
  BI->>DB: resume done
